  "overviews": {
    "zh-CN": "提供系统窗口管理能力，支持枚举窗口、置顶/移动/调整大小、最小化/最大化、获取窗口截图、焦点切换等功能。",
    "en-US": "System window management including window enumeration, topmost/move/resize, minimize/maximize, window screenshot, and focus switching."
  },
